+The upstream release is laid out as a script directory and imports modules
+such as ``utils`` by their top-level name.  In this workspace that name is
+owned by REAL-Q's shared utilities, so TurboBoA is intentionally a package
+and all of its internal imports are relative.  Launch it from the workspace
+root with ``python -m turboBOA.main``.
+"""
